{"unit_id":"cogito0823__dsh-motion#feature-1","repo":"cogito0823/dsh-motion","commit":"54a55a612ce2111184c1c029c9808dbf5bd259ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion 的功能「关键帧预览」：从 Manim 场景生成指定时间点的 storyboard PNG，并返回版式问题。调用 motion_frames，输入项目或场景文件及可选时间点，得到图像路径和检查结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:195-220","lib/ops.js:303-365"]}
{"unit_id":"cogito0823__dsh-motion#feature-2","repo":"cogito0823/dsh-motion","commit":"54a55a612ce2111184c1c029c9808dbf5bd259ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion 的功能「动画渲染」：把数学或科学场景输出为视频。调用 motion_render，输入项目、场景及可选尺寸和帧率，使用 manimgx 或 Manim 渲染，并返回成片信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:224-263"]}
{"unit_id":"cogito0823__dsh-motion#feature-3","repo":"cogito0823/dsh-motion","commit":"54a55a612ce2111184c1c029c9808dbf5bd259ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion 的功能「公式等价校验」：用 SymPy 判断两个表达式是否恒等。调用 formula_check，分别传入 left 和 right 表达式，获得等价检查结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:291-309"]}
{"unit_id":"cogito0823__dsh-motion#feature-4","repo":"cogito0823/dsh-motion","commit":"54a55a612ce2111184c1c029c9808dbf5bd259ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-motion 的功能「成片检查」：扫描已有视频并报告全黑或过曝帧，同时生成联系表并提供帧率、帧数和可变帧率信息。调用 motion_probe，输入 MP4 路径与可选帧数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:266-286","lib/ops.js:470-560"]}
